sequenceDiagram
  participant Op as Operator
  participant Sup as Deterministic Supervisor
  participant Mak as Maker (Model Family A)
  participant Prx as Capability Proxy
  participant Chk as Checker (Model Family B, RO)
  participant Own as Accountable Owner

  Op->>Sup: Submit task + maxBudgetUsd
  Sup->>Sup: Verify disjoint writePaths & budget < 80%
  Sup->>Mak: Dispatch HandoffPacket
  Mak->>Prx: Call stage_adr_draft (Tier 1 + idempotencyKey)
  Prx-->>Mak: Draft receipt + SHA-256
  Sup->>Chk: Dispatch CleanRoomPacket (writePaths=[])
  Chk-->>Sup: Verdict PASS (maker != checker verified)
  Mak->>Prx: Call approve_release_gate (Tier 2)
  Prx-->>Own: Pending approval (payloadSha256)
  Own->>Prx: Submit signed approvalToken
  Prx-->>Sup: Committed receipt
